  "summary": "NG-MVPN (RFC 6513/6514) over MPLS L3VPN. Two PEs, one P core router, customer multicast encapsulated in PMSI tunnels signaled by BGP MCAST-VPN AFI. C-sources/C-receivers on CEs in VRF CUST-A. Combines MPLS L3VPN blueprint with PIM inside the VRF.",
